                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The shop has been open for about two years, and the prices are reasonable. The second floor can be booked entirely for a minimum spend of 4000. I\u0027ve lived in Jingmei for 40 years and came here after reading Google reviews. I opened two bottles of red wine and smoked hookah twice. The hookah itself isn\u0027t expensive, but it doesn\u0027t last long.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "大概開兩年的店，價格算平價，二樓可以包場只需要低消4000，住在景美40年了，看Google評論過來\n開了兩瓶紅酒，水煙抽了兩次，如果水煙來講價格並貴，但是抽不久",
